@death_penalty

How should the party go about it? Cautiously, with compromises, it will cost a resource, do less and anger less. In full, it will do all that it says, and its opponents will answer. And a party strong enough can carry it out and break its opponents.

- @death_penalty_slow: Go about it cautiously, with compromises.
- @death_penalty_decree: Carry it out in full.
- @death_penalty_force: Carry it out in full, and break any opposition by force.

@death_penalty_slow
choose-if: resources >= 1
subtitle: Milder effects and little anger. Costs 1 resource.
unavailable-subtitle: We have nothing to pay the compensation with.
on-arrival: {!

RO.law(Q, 'slow', () => {
RO.add(Q, {army_discipline: 8, bolshevik: 4, rel_kad: 4, right_threat: 3});
RO.boost(Q, {soldiers: -6, workers: -2});
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 8);
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 0, 2);
}, "Restore the death penalty at the front");
!}

The death penalty at the front was restored for desertion and treason. The Bolshevik press called it "the gallows of the Menshevik ministers". (It was done cautiously, with compromises.)



